      "name": "assistant-durability.md",
      "filePath": "packages/agent/docs/assistant-durability.md",
      "summary": "Assistant 部分消息持久化的实现交接文档：用可回放的 stream frames 在进程丢失后重建最新 committed partial，并与 values 地址及 harness 的 intent/effect/settlement 状态机对齐。覆盖存储、帧契约、结算与未知结果恢复、取消、deferred polling、快照重连、不变量与必测项。",
      "tags": ["documentation", "durability", "assistant", "handoff", "harness"],
      "complexity": "complex"
    },
    {
      "id": "document:packages/agent/docs/harness.md",
      "type": "document",
      "name": "harness.md",
      "filePath": "packages/agent/docs/harness.md",
      "summary": "AgentHarness 的规范性实现规格，按章节定义三存储模型、会话树与 Branch/Lane、operation 状态机、Drive/恢复/中止/关闭、公共表面、schema 演进、工作包以及 38 条不变量与测试分层。",
      "tags": ["documentation", "specification", "harness", "entry-point", "state-machine"],
      "complexity": "complex",
      "languageNotes": "长篇编号规范（§N.M），附录含术语表与 coding-agent v3 格式兼容说明。"
    },
    {
